Task description for a freelancer to develop an MVP for a web service using the bubble.io solution. The main idea of the project is to help job seekers create high-quality resumes and automatically send them to recruiters who have subscribed to candidate notifications.

Functional requirements:

User registration and authentication;
Creation of a job seeker profile with the ability to add information about their work experience, education, and other skills;
Resume creation based on the information provided by the user;
Ability to add and edit various sections in the resume, such as work experience, education, skills, achievements, etc.;
Ability to attach photos and other documents to the resume;
Saving the resume in PDF format;
Automatic sending of the resume to recruiters who have subscribed to candidate notifications;
Ability to view the status of resume sending and receive notifications about recruiter responses.
Technical requirements:

Development on the bubble.io platform;
The design should be simple and intuitive;
The system should be scalable and easily modifiable.
Additional requirements:

Integration of a payment system for monetizing the service;
Ability to add advertising banners;
Implementation of a feature to send notifications to users' mobile devices;
Ability to add new interface languages.

The description is under NDA. 
Functionality: 
1. Google auth for users; 
2. Custom forms; 
3. Send Emails by events; 
4. Ranking system. 

